# parts folders: only our own sources and their READMEs are committed:
#   *.scad      OpenSCAD models
#   make_*.py   FreeCAD scripts that build a part
#   README.md   what the part is and which local files it needs
# Manufacturer / third-party models (boards, drivers, cases, Printables downloads) and exported STL/STEP files stay
# local. Each README says where to get them or how to rebuild them.
smart-panel/panel/parts/**
!smart-panel/panel/parts/**/
!smart-panel/panel/parts/**/*.scad
!smart-panel/panel/parts/**/make_*.py
!smart-panel/panel/parts/**/README.md

robot Bruut/openscad/parts/**
!robot Bruut/openscad/parts/**/
!robot Bruut/openscad/parts/**/*.scad
!robot Bruut/openscad/parts/**/README.md
# Own steering motor plate (HiCAD export), the reference the FreeCAD model is rebuilt from.
!robot Bruut/openscad/parts/PLOATIE 2.STP
